#: src/rs-box.c:275
msgid "Another master owns this segment, so there is no preamp control here."
msgstr "Another master owns this segment, so there is no preamp control here."

#: src/rs-box.c:277
msgid ""
"This box is strapped to REAC master mode. Its preamps are set on the box "
"itself, over its serial port — REAC carries no preamp control to a box in "
"master mode."
msgstr "This box is strapped to REAC master mode. Its preamps are set on the box itself, over its serial port — REAC carries no preamp control to a box in master mode."

#: src/rs-box.c:279
msgid "No stagebox recognised on this segment yet."
msgstr "No stagebox recognised on this segment yet."

#: src/rs-box.c:281
msgid ""
"The box has announced no head-amp base, so its inputs have no wire address."
msgstr "The box has announced no head-amp base, so its inputs have no wire address."

#: src/rs-box.c:283
msgid "The link to this box is not established."
msgstr "The link to this box is not established."

#: src/rs-box.c:285
msgid ""
"No readback from this daemon: it publishes no head-amp state, so a change "
"could not be confirmed. Shown read-only."
msgstr "No readback from this daemon: it publishes no head-amp state, so a change could not be confirmed. Shown read-only."

#: src/rs-box.c:295
msgid "Refused: the box is in master mode."
msgstr "Refused: the box is in master mode."

